48:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"It does not survive a move to the Redis scheduler backend."}],"\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"execution.active.count"}],", the series this whole page depends on, is emitted\nonly by the in-memory awaited-action store.\nUnder ",["$","code",null,{"children":"experimental_backend"}],", the queue-depth series is not emitted at all and\nthe HPA has nothing to read."]}]
