59:["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Drain on scale-in, as far as the API allows."}]," This is the part where honesty\nis more useful than a clean recipe."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["The drain endpoint takes a worker id the pod does not know at startup; the\nscheduler generates it at registration and returns it over the wire (the\nworker logs it once, in its ",["$","code",null,{"children":"Worker registered with scheduler"}]," line)."]}],["$","$L4f",null,{"className":"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark","style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292e","--shiki-dark":"#e1e4e8","--shiki-light-bg":"#fff","--shiki-dark-bg":"#24292e"},"tabIndex":"0","icon":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M 6,1 C 4.354992,1 3,2.354992 3,4 v 16 c 0,1.645008 1.354992,3 3,3 h 12 c 1.645008,0 3,-1.354992 3,-3 V 8 7 A 1.0001,1.0001 0 0 0 20.707031,6.2929687 l -5,-5 A 1.0001,1.0001 0 0 0 15,1 h -1 z m 0,2 h 7 v 3 c 0,1.645008 1.354992,3 3,3 h 3 v 11 c 0,0.564129 -0.435871,1 -1,1 H 6 C 5.4358712,21 5,20.564129 5,20 V 4 C 5,3.4358712 5.4358712,3 6,3 Z M 15,3.4140625 18.585937,7 H 16 C 15.435871,7 15,6.5641288 15,6 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /></svg>","children":["$","$L50",null,{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"className":"line","children":["$","span",null,{"children":"POST {admin_path}/scheduler/{scheduler_name}/set_drain_worker/{worker_id}/1"}]}]}]}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["The second path segment is the scheduler's ",["$","code",null,{"children":"name"}]," from the ",["$","code",null,{"children":"schedulers"}]," list\n(",["$","code",null,{"children":"MAIN_SCHEDULER"}]," in the shipped config), not the REAPI instance name. Because\nyou set ",["$","code",null,{"children":"name"}]," to the pod name in step 3, the id is discoverable: it is the\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"execution_worker_id"}]," label on the execution series the scheduler emits for\nthat worker's actions, prefixed with the pod name.\n",["