5b:["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Leave the CAS out of the autoscaler."}]," The HPA scales workers and nothing\nelse. A CAS process holds per-process state that makes a second replica a\nproject rather than a replica count; ",["$","$L1b",null,{"href":"/operate/scaling-cas","children":"scaling the CAS"}],"\ncovers which state and why. What the CAS needs from this deployment is a\nreadiness probe with enough patience for its startup scan."]}],["$","$L4f",null,{"className":"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark","style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292e","--shiki-dark":"#e1e4e8","--shiki-light-bg":"#fff","--shiki-dark-bg":"#24292e"},"tabIndex":"0","icon":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M 6,1 C 4.354992,1 3,2.354992 3,4 v 16 c 0,1.645008 1.354992,3 3,3 h 12 c 1.645008,0 3,-1.354992 3,-3 V 8 7 A 1.0001,1.0001 0 0 0 20.707031,6.2929687 l -5,-5 A 1.0001,1.0001 0 0 0 15,1 h -1 z m 0,2 h 7 v 3 c 0,1.645008 1.354992,3 3,3 h 3 v 11 c 0,0.564129 -0.435871,1 -1,1 H 6 C 5.4358712,21 5,20.564129 5,20 V 4 C 5,3.4358712 5.4358712,3 6,3 Z M 15,3.4140625 18.585937,7 H 16 C 15.435871,7 15,6.5641288 15,6 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /></svg>","children":["$","$L50",null,{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"line","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#22863A","--shiki-dark":"#85E89D"},"children":"readinessProbe"}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292E","--shiki-dark":"#E1E4E8"},"children":":"}]]}],"\n",["$","span",null,{"className":"line","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#22863A","--shiki-dark":"#85E89D"},"children":"  httpGet"}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292E","--shiki-dark":"#E1E4E8"},"children":":"}]]}],"\n",["$","span",null,{"className":"line","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#22863A","--shiki-dark":"#85E89D"},"children":"    path"}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292E","--shiki-